    "rawContent": "---\nname: consult\ndescription: Comprehensive AI consultation gateway\ncategory: workflow\ntriggers:\n  - /consult\n  - \"consultation\"\n  - \"advisory\"\naliases:\n  - /consult\n\nsuggest:\n  - /search\n  - /nse\n  - /llm-brainstorm\n---\n\n# /consult\n\nComprehensive AI consultation for workflow orchestration.\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide comprehensive AI consultation gateway for workflow orchestration, routing to appropriate specialized systems based on user needs.\n\n## Project Context\n\n### Constitution/Constraints\n- **Subagent-First** - Route to specialist consultation systems\n- **User Choice** - Present options when appropriate\n- **Investigation Before Recommendations** - Understand context before suggesting\n\n### Technical Context\n- Main documentation: `P:/__csf/src/core/consultation/consult.md`\n- Routes to various consultation systems:\n  - `/search` for knowledge queries\n  - `/nse` for development recommendations\n  - `/llm-brainstorm` for multi-provider AI consultation\n\n### Architecture Alignment\n- Works with `/search`, `/nse`, `/llm-brainstorm`\n- Central consultation routing hub\n\n## Your Workflow\n\n1. Parse user consultation request\n2. Identify consultation type:\n   - Knowledge search \u2192 route to `/search`\n   - Development guidance \u2192 route to `/nse`\n   - Multi-provider AI \u2192 route to `/llm-brainstorm`\n   - General workflow \u2192 use internal consultation logic\n3. Execute appropriate consultation\n4. Present findings with citations\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n### Prohibited Actions\n\n- Do NOT make recommendations without understanding user context\n- Do NOT skip routing to appropriate specialist\n- Do NOT provide consultation without evidence sources\n\n**Main docs:** `P:/__csf/src/core/consultation/consult.md`\n"
