    "rawContent": "---\nname: crawl\ndescription: Crawl web pages (legacy - integrated into /research)\ncategory: research\ntriggers:\n  - /crawl\naliases:\n  - /crawl\n\nsuggest:\n  - /research\n  - /ingest\n  - /docs\n---\n\n# /crawl - Crawl Web Pages\n\n**This command is now integrated into the unified `/research` command**\n\n## Purpose\n\nCrawl web pages for content extraction. **DEPRECATED: Integrated into `/research`** - Use `/research <url>` for enhanced functionality.\n\n## Project Context\n\n### Constitution/Constraints\n- **Evidence-First** - Extract actual content, not summaries\n- **Complete Solutions** - Full content extraction, not partial\n\n### Technical Context\n- **Legacy Status**: Integrated into `/research` command\n- **Enhanced Capabilities in /research**:\n  - Multi-source research\n  - Intelligent auto-selection\n  - Semantic ranking\n\n### Architecture Alignment\n- **Deprecated**: Use `/research` instead\n- `/research` provides: `/crawl`, `/ingest`, and more\n\n## Your Workflow\n\n### Migration Path\n\n```bash\n# Old way (deprecated)\n/crawl https://github.com/example/repo\n\n# New way (enhanced)\n/research https://github.com/example/repo\n```\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n### Prohibited Actions\n\n- Do NOT use `/crawl` for new workflows - use `/research`\n- Do NOT extend `/crawl` functionality - enhance `/research` instead\n\n## Migration\n\n```bash\n# Old way\n/crawl https://github.com/example/repo\n\n# New way (enhanced)\n/research https://github.com/example/repo\n```\n"
