    "rawContent": "---\nname: sar-help\ndescription: SAR Help - CWO-compliant sub-agent coordination docs\ncategory: documentation\ntriggers:\n  - /sar-help\naliases:\n  - /sar-help\n\nsuggest:\n  - /sar-inst\n  - /cwo\n  - /orchestrator\n---\n\n# SAR Help\n\nSAR is CWO-Compliant sub-agent coordination for complex tasks.\n\n## Purpose\n\nSAR Help documentation for CWO-compliant sub-agent coordination in complex task execution.\n\n## Project Context\n\n### Constitution/Constraints\n- CWO (Concurrent Workflow Orchestrator) compliant\n- Sub-agent coordination for complex tasks\n- Evidence-based validation required\n\n### Technical Context\n- Workflow: Constitutional Pre-Check \u2192 Plan Enhancement \u2192 Advisory Analysis \u2192 Task Decomposition \u2192 Sub-Agent Integration \u2192 Evidence-Based Validation \u2192 Knowledge Integration\n\n### Architecture Alignment\n- Integrates with `/sar-inst` for SAR implementation\n- Works alongside `/cwo` for workflow orchestration\n- Suggests `/orchestrator` for multi-agent coordination\n\n## Your Workflow\n\n1. **Constitutional Pre-Check**: Validate against CSF NIP principles\n2. **Plan Enhancement**: Refine approach with constitutional constraints\n3. **Advisory Analysis**: Analyze requirements and constraints\n4. **Task Decomposition**: Break into atomic subtasks\n5. **Sub-Agent Integration**: Coordinate specialist sub-agents\n6. **Evidence-Based Validation**: Verify all outputs with evidence\n7. **Knowledge Integration**: Store learnings in CKS\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n### Prohibited Actions\n- Do NOT skip constitutional pre-check\n- Do NOT proceed without evidence-based validation\n- Do NOT use sub-agents for trivial (reversibility <1.5) tasks\n\n### Required Evidence\n- All claims must cite source (file:line, output, etc.)\n- Validation results must be shown\n- Sub-agent outputs must be aggregated\n\n## Usage\n\n/sar \"Build REST API with authentication\"\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Constitutional Pre-Check\n2. Plan Enhancement\n3. Advisory Analysis\n4. Task Decomposition\n5. Sub-Agent Integration\n6. Evidence-Based Validation\n7. Knowledge Integration\n"
