    "rawContent": "---\nname: vdate-deploy\ndescription: Deploy verification using git commands\ncategory: validation\ntriggers:\n  - /vdate-deploy\naliases:\n  - /vdate-deploy\n\nsuggest:\n  - /vdate-quality\n  - /vdate-tdd\n---\n\n# Vdate Deploy\n\nVerify git repository status before deployment.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/vdate-deploy file.py\n/vdate-deploy\n```\n\n## What It Checks\n\n- Git repository status\n- Uncommitted changes\n- Branch verification\n\n## Implementation\n\nCalls `run_deploy_check()` from `hybrid_orchestrator.py`.\n\n## Exit Codes\n\n- `0` = PASS (repository is clean)\n- `1` = FAIL (uncommitted changes or issues)\n"
