    "rawContent": "---\nname: vdate-quality\ndescription: Code quality check using radon and ruff\ncategory: validation\ntriggers:\n  - /vdate-quality\naliases:\n  - /vdate-quality\n\nsuggest:\n  - /vdate-syntax\n  - /vdate-security\n---\n\n# Vdate Quality\n\nCheck Python code quality using radon (cyclomatic complexity) and ruff (linting).\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/vdate-quality file.py\n/vdate-quality file1.py,file2.py\n```\n\n## What It Checks\n\n### Radon (Cyclomatic Complexity)\n- Measures code complexity\n- Flags overly complex functions (A-F grading)\n- Average complexity score\n\n### Ruff (Python Linter)\n- Code style issues\n- Unused imports\n- Potential bugs\n- PEP 8 compliance\n\n## Implementation\n\nCalls `run_quality_check()` from `hybrid_orchestrator.py`.\n\n## Exit Codes\n\n- `0` = PASS (quality checks passed)\n- `1` = FAIL (quality issues detected)\n"
