    "rawContent": "---\nname: vdate-tdd\ndescription: TDD validation using pytest\ncategory: validation\ntriggers:\n  - /vdate-tdd\naliases:\n  - /vdate-tdd\n\nsuggest:\n  - /vdate-quality\n  - /vdate-syntax\n---\n\n# Vdate TDD\n\nRun test suite using pytest to verify TDD compliance.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/vdate-tdd file.py\n/vdate-tdd tests/\n```\n\n## What It Checks\n\n- Test execution via pytest\n- Test failures and errors\n- Test coverage (if configured)\n\n## Implementation\n\nCalls `run_tdd_check()` from `hybrid_orchestrator.py`.\n\n## Exit Codes\n\n- `0` = PASS (tests pass)\n- `1` = FAIL (tests failed)\n"
