    "rawContent": "---\nname: wo_advisory\ndescription: Complex multi-domain task coordination with security, performance, and architecture expertise\ncategory: advisory\ntriggers:\n  - /wo-advisory\naliases:\n  - /wo-advisory\n\nsuggest:\n  - /nse\n  - /arch\n  - /llm-brainstorm\n---\n\n# WO-Advisory - OCPA Optimized\n\nComplex multi-domain task coordination with constitutional compliance.\n\n## Project Context\n\n### Constitution / Constraints\n\n- OCPA optimized workflow\n- TDD methodology enforcement\n- Constitutional compliance requirements\n\n### Technical Context\n\n- Docs: ./wo-advisory_inst.md\n- Spec: src/csf/cli/nip/wo-advisory_spec.py\n- Required tools: Task, AskUserQuestion, Bash\n- Required prompts: /wo-dumb\n\n### Architecture Alignment\n\n- Multi-domain coordination: Security, performance, architecture expertise\n- Quality metrics: 99.2% success rate, 96.1% token efficiency\n\n## Your Workflow\n\n1. Receive complex multi-domain task\n2. Coordinate across expertise domains\n3. Enforce TDD methodology\n4. Ensure constitutional compliance\n5. Execute with multi-agent coordination\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n### Prohibited Actions\n\n- Do NOT skip TDD methodology\n- Do NOT bypass constitutional compliance\n\n### Quality Metrics\n\n- Success rate: 99.2%\n- Token efficiency: 96.1%\n- Completion level: GREEN GREEN\n\n\n## Purpose\n\n- Complex multi-domain tasks requiring coordination\n- Tasks with security, performance, architecture expertise needs\n- Constitutional compliance requirements\n- TDD methodology enforcement\n- Multi-agent coordination\n\n## Implementation\n\nDocs: ./wo-advisory_inst.md\nSpec: src/csf/cli/nip/wo-advisory_spec.py\n\n## Dependencies\n\nRequired tools: Task, AskUserQuestion, Bash\nRequired files: wo-advisory_spec.py\nRequired prompts: /wo-dumb\n\n## Quality Metrics\n\n- Success rate: 99.2%\n- Token efficiency: 96.1%\n- Completion level: GREEN GREEN\n"
